w shows each project's current-month GPU-hour consumption alongside its Kueue quota, from the report API's data.\n46\t- The view integrates as a standard Dashboard section (navigation, list, and detail patterns) consistent with the existing console architecture.\n47\t\n48\t## HLR Traceability\n49\t\n50\t- HLR-1 (P0): administrator viewing portion — administrators can view per-project GPU-hour consumption reports.\n51\t- HLR-3 (P1, bundled): the current-month-vs-quota comparison renders in the same Dashboard admin view surface as the report viewing — one surface, not a separately schedulable deliverable.\n52\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-92ad73f8c77462c4","agent_id":"a1b066e547b0cfa33","session_id":"9b38e4b5-1cb5-4536-862e-6126a53124be","uuid":"74503e37-4458-4b66-9b21-0ef95524da7f","timestamp":"2026-10-23T19:05:02.430Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-80a8767d9fb83168","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9018 decomposition"}
